55.6222],[12.1579,55.6706],[12.258,55.7122],[12.2405,55.7412],[12.0761,55.7789]]]]},"knowledge":{"theme":"首都大区 · 地点概要","geo":"此区域管辖范围包含首都哥本哈根所在的西兰岛东北部及位于西兰岛东南方的博恩霍尔姆岛。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q26073","articleTitle":"首都大区","sourceRevision":94482968,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 首都大区","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%96%E9%83%BD%E5%A4%A7%E5%8C%BA"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94482968"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q26073"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}}],"cities":[{"id":"city-1159151437","name":"哥本哈根","country":"DNK","lat":55.68051,"lon":12.56154,"kind":"city","region":"DK-84","rank":2,"capital":1,"knowledge":{"theme":"哥本哈根 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"2009年12月，联合国气候变化大会在哥本哈根举行，在国际上引发关注。\n哥本哈根位于丹麦第一大岛西兰岛上，与瑞典的马尔默隔海相望。\n从地质上来看哥本哈根位于冰川时期留下来的冰碛层上（丹麦大多数地区是冰碛层）。","culture":"传统上哥本哈根最早的记录在12世纪末，最近的考古发现在国王新广场附近有一个大型商人宅邸的遗迹，时间约为1020年。\n传统上，哥本哈根的建城年是1167年，这一年在城堡岛上建立了第一座城堡，位置就位于现在的克里斯蒂安堡宫。","see":"1416年，波美拉尼亚的埃里克决定将他的王座迁到哥本哈根城堡，哥本哈根由此成为丹麦的首都。\n在克里斯蒂安四世的倡议下，17世纪初城堡岛兴建了两个重要建筑，兵工厂（现在的哥本哈根军事博物馆）以及股票交易中心。\n克里斯蒂安四世还赞助了包括罗森堡城堡和圆塔在内的地标性建筑项目。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1748","articleTitle":"哥本哈根","sourceRevision":94237442,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 哥本哈根","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%93%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%93%88%E6%A0%B9"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94237442"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1748"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148699","name":"奥胡斯","country":"DNK","lat":56.1572,"lon":10.21068,"kind":"city","region":"DK-82","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"奥胡斯 · 地点概要","geo":"奥胡斯（，；1948年至2010年称为“”）位于日德兰半岛沿岸，是丹麦第二大城市和主要的港口。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q25319","articleTitle":"奥胡斯","sourceRevision":93513412,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 奥胡斯","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%A5%E8%83%A1%E6%96%AF"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93513412"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q25319"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159143033","name":"斯温堡","country":"DNK","lat":55.07042,"lon":10.61665,"kind":"city","region":"DK-83","rank":7,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159143035","name":"欧登塞","country":"DNK","lat":55.40038,"lon":10.38334,"kind":"city","region":"DK-83","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"欧登塞 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"欧登塞位于丹麦首都哥本哈根到日德兰半岛之间，是哥本哈根通往日德兰半岛的必经之地。","culture":"欧登塞是丹麦最古老的城市之一，建于988年。\n大贝尔特桥是世界上第二长悬索桥，1997年铁路通车，1998年公路也随后建成。","see":"现在位于欧登塞老城区的一所房子已经改成博物馆，收集了安徒生大量的作品和用品。\n古典音乐作曲家和指挥家卡尔·尼尔森于1865年6月9日出生在欧登塞南部小村庄Sortelung，如今该村庄建立了一座博物馆来纪念他。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q25331","articleTitle":"欧登塞","sourceRevision":89888437,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 欧登塞","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AC%A7%E7%99%BB%E5%A1%9E"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89888437"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q25331"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159143041","name":"埃斯比约","country":"DNK","lat":55.46704,"lon":8.45002,"kind":"city","region":"DK-83","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"埃斯比约 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"埃斯比约是丹麦西南部南丹麦大区埃斯比约市镇内的海港及行政中心。","culture":"埃斯比约的城市系环绕港口兴建，创建于1868年，以取代丹麦原来最重要的北海港口Altona。\n埃斯比约是一个大型铁路与公路交通枢纽，还有一个机场。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q26234","articleTitle":"埃斯比约","sourceRevision":94290240,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 埃斯比约","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9F%83%E6%96%AF%E6%AF%94%E7%BA%A6"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94290240"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q26234"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159143045","name":"腓特烈港","country":"DNK","lat":57.43369,"lon":10.5333,"kind":"city","region":"DK-81","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"腓特烈港 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"腓特烈港是丹麦北日德兰大区腓特烈港市镇的一个小城镇，位于日德兰半岛北海岸线上，是丹麦通往挪威和瑞典渡轮的重要港口。","culture":"如今保留下来的军事设施是建于1688年的炮塔，以及北入口。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q27452","articleTitle":"腓特烈港 (丹麦)","sourceRevision":89890869,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 腓特烈港 (丹麦)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%85%93%E7%89%B9%E7%83%88%E6%B8%AF%20%28%E4%B8%B9%E9%BA%A6%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89890869"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q27452"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159143049","name":"奥尔堡","country":"DNK","lat":57.03371,"lon":9.91659,"kind":"city","region":"DK-81","rank":7,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"奥尔堡 · 地点概要","geo":"奥尔堡（ / ，）是丹麦第四大城市，位于日德兰半岛北部和利姆海峡南岸。","culture":null,"see"